  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>When a creature you can see within 30 feet of you makes an attack roll, you can take a Reaction to impose Disadvantage on it, as light flares before it hits or misses. You can use this feature a number of times equal to your Wisdom modifier (minimum of once), and you regain all expended uses when you finish a Long Rest.</p><section class=\"secret\" id=\"secret-EoTWdJjYXNKIGnV4\"><p><strong>Foundry Note</strong></p><p>From level 6 (Improved Warding Flare), the uses also come back on a Short Rest: add that recovery to this feature.</p></section>",
